    "body": "Reported: every PDF opened in Preview (the hard-coded fallback) instead of the previous viewer (Highlights), and never in DEVONthink.\n\n- Fallback: `DT_OPEN_FALLBACK` unset now means the viewer that was the default before `dt-open-install` (recorded when `duti` is installed), then Preview. Set `DT_OPEN_FALLBACK=Highlights` to be explicit. The shipped config no longer sets it.\n- Visibility: `DT_OPEN_DEBUG=1` logs paths tried, databases asked and errors to `~/Library/Logs/DT Open PDF.log`; the Automation error (-1743) shows an alert; a non-list lookup result counts as no match.\n- README.org: new section \"When every PDF opens in the fallback viewer\" (Automation permission, is the PDF indexed, a Terminal test of the lookup, the log).\n- Tangled files regenerated the way Emacs does it (blank lines at block ends trimmed).\n- Not run on a Mac; the cause of the failed lookup is not known yet. Most likely the Automation permission or the PDFs not being indexed.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNiBSPryU16ZirHGRiaX)_",
